@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "WenQuanYi Zen Hei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam rectangle { BackgroundColor #F7F7F5
BorderColor #444444
RoundCorner 14 }
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam ArrowFontSize 13
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFBEA
skinparam NoteBorderColor #C9B458
skinparam padding 8
left to right direction
rectangle "道\n同一个模型名 × 一家卖场或接口" as Lane
rectangle "案\n一道计分题；分母的单位" as Case
rectangle "卷\n一次作答记录；同一案可有多卷" as Run
rectangle "结果\n过 · 没过 · NA" as Result
Lane -right-> Run : 作答
Case -right-> Run : 考的是
Run -right-> Result : 判分
note bottom of Result
NA = 作废或暂停：不算过，也不算没过。
end note
@enduml
